config DRM_ACCEL_SOPHGO_TPU
	tristate "Sophgo SG2000 TPU Accelerator"
	depends on DRM_ACCEL
	depends on ARCH_SOPHGO || COMPILE_TEST
	select DRM_GEM_DMA_HELPER
	help
	  DRM/accel driver for the Tensor Processing Unit (TPU) found
	  in Sophgo SG2000/CV1813H SoCs (e.g., Milk-V Duo S).

	  The TPU provides 0.5 TOPS INT8 inference capability for
	  neural network models compiled with the Sophgo TPU-MLIR
	  toolchain (.bmodel format).

	  This driver exposes the TPU via /dev/accel/accelN using
	  standard DRM GEM buffer management, replacing the vendor's
	  proprietary ION-based driver.

	  If unsure, say N.
